statement=('Fresh immutable pipeline recurrence supplies 4050 regular committed Git inputs with no overlays. Nine complete guarded commands recur all eleven regex and eight statement contracts under three seeds:207 original returned/constructor/argument identities and scalar origins,135 authored statement frames and all five unchanged default callback effects. Three complete Toolbox channels equal the exact prior committed proof byte-for-byte. Fourteen unchanged direct suites pass803 ordered groups; three foreign-source probes retain events with zero invented origins. Normalized split metadata and the actual equal-valued returned-array copy distinguisher recur unchanged. Twenty-four reason-specific evidence controls observe RED. Complete58-input book renders ten original examples/three chapters with fourteen rejection controls. All38 prior claim input hashes verify before historical mode/revision-only freeze.')
scope=('Nineteen PrimitivePipelineRules private regex/statement provenance contracts at immutable clean '+REVISION+'. Complete regular Git inventory is a conservative supplied-input superset, not minimal observed IO; every original object/content/mode/member is recoverable from that exact Git boundary, without candidate overlays. Every actual command retains full stdout/stderr and before/after content/mode/population guards. Independent review binds current Perl/spec/test bytes and actual imported oracle/reviewer/probe/prior-channel inputs. Literal raw/argument/interval/plan oracle authors cumulative scalar coordinates without searching observed raw text. Quoted regex observations remain syntactic, not executable membership. Statement authority retains ignored-frame occurrence alignment, both hash/value-discard constructors and actual returned-array/constructor/argument references. Complete earlier regression fixtures cover nested/error/caller-error/empty/rejected/copied/changed/opaque/foreign/transformed boundaries. Original self-comparison marker remains historically limited; current probe and actual copied-return control distinguish equal values from returned reference identity without changing dedicated older test adjudications. Gitlinks/nonregular metadata excluded without payload reads. Host OS/Perl/Python/prove/mdBook are necessary read-only tools; project data stays on repository volume. Final book inputs/render are separately retained; rendered examples are not native execution. Exact staged canonical CI receipt is separately mandatory before pipeline parent closure; this record publishes no new canonical CI measurement. Remaining Flow/legacy/staged producers, source membership/comments/replacement, arbitrary host syntax or malicious callbacks, backend/native admission and global historical audit remain separate. No production/spec/standard-test/CI/hook/storage/dependency or other-repository changes.')
record={'version':1,'owner':OWNER,'claims':[{'name':'nineteen-pipeline-family-immutable-recurrence','statement':statement,'scope':scope,
'rederive':{'status':'checked','command':'; '.join('bash tools/run_python_project_data.sh '+PREFIX+x for x in ('capture.py','review.py','freeze.py','book.py --review')),'granularity':'4050 immutable regular inputs/no overlays/nine commands;19 contracts/3 seeds/207 original origins/135 frames;14 suites/803 groups/3 foreign probes;58 book inputs/10 examples/3 chapters;38 prior hashes.','result':statement},
'falsify':{'status':'checked','hypothesis':'Missing contract/event/constructor occurrence, wrong arguments, reused equal-text frames, copied returned events, changed callback/compiler channels, omitted inputs or incomplete TAP could falsely pass family acceptance.','oracle':'Independent original literal source/argument/interval/plan oracle and corrected actual returned-array/constructor/argument reference probe; exact earlier complete channel recurrence; immutable Git object/content/mode/membership and all imported producer/prior inputs; full ordered positive TAP and nested-failure rejection. Actual equal-valued returned-event copy retains old marker true and required relationship false.','red_control':'Twenty-four observed reason-specific RED controls reject erased contracts/events/ignored/nested/literal frames, changed args/reused origins, forged returned/constructor/argument references, lost callbacks/extended public schema/compiler success, invented foreign origins, missing/forged inputs/prior channels, incomplete capture/producer/exit/channel, shortened TAP/nested failure and promoted tautological copied-return flag. Fourteen render controls reject failed/forged/missing guards/channels/examples/teaching.'},
'durability':{'status':'checked','mode':'live','inputs':inputs}}]}
